Z||000000||Songman||04-24-2001||04:54 PM||||Hey everybody! This is a longshot, but I am wondering if anyone is coming through Indy this weekend on the way to the swap meet in Alabama. I went up there and picked up my t-top yesterday and had to leave a front and rear fascia because I didn't have anyway to haul it. If anyone is coming that way with a truck, and it could be worked out, I would pay a little to get it dropped off in Nashville. I could probably even get it home from Alabama and no one would have to make an extra stop.<P>If anyone is coming this way and wouldn't mind trying to work it out, please contact me. I appreciate it....<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||BOILERMAKER||04-24-2001||07:48 PM||||I live in Indy (well, the south side).  I was planning on driving the new restore, but may possibly be persuaded into bringing the truck instead (depends on how much guff I get from the crew I am meeting down there).  Anyway, email me and let me know where it is and we can discuss it further.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Songman||04-24-2001||08:05 PM||||Thanks Mike... sending you an e-mail!<BR>May not be able to work it out logistically though. The guy lives up in W. Lafayette about an hour and a half North.. I don't want to put anyone out. Just thought if someone was passing by it would save me a trip...<P>Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 04-24-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000003||FieroGTguy||04-25-2001||02:47 PM||||Tis I.  The former owner of Songman's Fiero.  You can get with me if you can get to the Purdue Campus before heading to the show.<P>Songman, I can't wait to see the T-Top after it has been restored and modified!<P>Greg||||reg||1
Z||000004||Songman||04-25-2001||06:24 PM||||Thanks Greg... Lots of ideas so far and hoping to start gathering parts...<P>I enjoyed our short visit when I picked up the car this weekend. And also, enjoyed seeing all of your projects. Hope we get to visit again, maybe at a Fiero show...<P>Looks like I'll be making a trip back up there later for the extra stuff. That's good though, I can bring you the extra Daytona hood too.... We'll talk about that later..<P>Thanks.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
